  "html": "<section class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align icon-plus-title is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-indoor-air-quality\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"has-link-color wp-elements-2 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-secondary-color has-x-large-font-size\">Air Duct Repair, Sealing, and Cleaning in Columbia, SC</h1></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group services-hero-description flow is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>2nd Wind Heating &amp; Air Conditioning inspects, seals, repairs, replaces, and cleans air ducts in Columbia, SC and across the Midlands. The technician records video inside and around the duct system, so you see the disconnected run or the lining of dust before you decide what to do about it.</p>\n<p>Duct problems tax a Columbia home twice. Supply leaks dump air you paid to cool into unconditioned space, and return leaks pull attic or crawl space air into the system, complete with its heat, humidity, dust, and insulation fibers. The house gets harder to cool and dirtier to breathe in at the same time.</p>\n<p>Duct performance and equipment performance are one system. If sealed ducts still leave rooms uneven, our <a href=\"/services/cooling-columbia-sc/air-conditioning\">air conditioning services</a> can evaluate the equipment, and rooms the duct layout simply cannot reach are candidates for a <a href=\"/services/cooling-columbia-sc/mini-split\">ductless mini split</a>. Homes fighting dust and allergens can pair clean ducts with an <a href=\"/services/indoor-air-quality-columbia-sc/air-scrubbers\">air scrubber</a>. Schedule a duct inspection with 2nd Wind by phone, online, or 24/7 chat, and watch the video of what is actually happening above and below your living space.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 full-width-mobile schedule-and-call-cta is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group schedule-cta-container is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<a href=\"/bookings\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta se-widget-button\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-event\" /></svg><span >Schedule Now</span>\n\n</a>\n\n    <p class=\"horizon-text has-secondary-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">or speak with an expert!</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+18033921513\" aria-label=\"Call now: +18033921513\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(803) 392-1513</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"has--color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size text-center wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same Day Appointments Available by Phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/02/A-technician-inspecting-an-air-duct-with-a-flashlight.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"A technician inspecting an air duct with a flashlight\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/A-technician-inspecting-an-air-duct-with-a-flashlight.jpg 1920w, /images/2024/02/A-technician-inspecting-an-air-duct-with-a-flashlight-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/02/A-technician-inspecting-an-air-duct-with-a-flashlight-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/02/A-technician-inspecting-an-air-duct-with-a-flashlight-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/02/A-technician-inspecting-an-air-duct-with-a-flashlight-1536x1024.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\"></div>\n\n</section>\n<!-- container /--><div id=\"types-of-services\" class=\"types-of-service-container container py-5 wp-elements-4 has-custom-acf-color has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-primary-inverse-color\"><!-- wp-block-columns/ -->\n        <div data-num-of-columns=\"3\" class=\"wp-block-columns mb-4 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-layout-1 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n    <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-toolbox\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Duct Inspection and Repair</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p class=\"FirstParagraph\">An inspection traces the duct runs, checks connections and supports, and measures how the system is delivering air room by room. Common findings in this market include crushed flex duct, separated joints, duct runs sweating in humid crawl spaces, and insulation that has slipped or soaked. Repairs reconnect, reroute, resupport, and reinsulate, and the video from the inspection shows you exactly which problems drove the quote.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-technician\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Duct Sealing</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p class=\"FirstParagraph\">Sealing closes the gaps at joints, boots, and plenum connections where conditioned air escapes. The result is measurable: more of the system&#8217;s output arrives in the rooms, the AC runs fewer hours for the same thermostat setting, and the pressure balance of the house stops pulling unfiltered air in through every gap. In a cooling season as long as Columbia&#8217;s, sealed ducts pay back through the power bill month after month.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-installation\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Duct Cleaning and Replacement</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p class=\"FirstParagraph\">Cleaning removes the accumulated dust, pollen, and debris lining the duct interior, which matters most after renovations, in homes with visible discharge at the registers, or where return leaks have been feeding the system crawl space air for years. Ducts past economical repair, such as collapsed runs or undersized trunk lines that choke the equipment, get replaced and sized correctly. Duct condition is also checked during Cloud 10 tune-ups on our <a href=\"/maintenance\">maintenance plans</a>.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        </div><!-- ./ wp-block-columns --> </div><!-- ./container -->\n<div class=\"our-promise container \" id=\"our-promise\">\n<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\">\n\n<figure class=\"our-promise__photo\">\n<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" src=\"/images/2024/02/indoor-air-quality-services-air-scrubbers-1024x683.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A man and woman relaxing on their couch, enjoying the crisp air in Columbia, SC\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/indoor-air-quality-services-air-scrubbers-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/02/indoor-air-quality-services-air-scrubbers-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/02/indoor-air-quality-services-air-scrubbers-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/02/indoor-air-quality-services-air-scrubbers-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/02/indoor-air-quality-services-air-scrubbers.jpg 1800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></figure>\n<div class=\"our-promise__info\">\n    <p class=\"h3 our-promise__info__headline\">Breathe Easier with Expert Indoor Air Quality Services</p>\n    <div class=\"our-promise__info__description\">Achieve better health and comfort with our superior indoor air quality solutions. At 2nd Wind HVAC, we specialize in air purification, filtration, and ventilation systems to help you breathe cleaner air and live healthier. Our team provides customized air quality assessments and solutions to fit your home’s unique needs. Trust us to enhance the air you breathe in Columbia, SC.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div  class=\"container splitter makes-and-models has-background has-white-background-color\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--center\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n        <div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\n<div  class=\"logogrid\" style=\"--count: 14;\">\n    <ul role=\"list\" class=\"logocarousel-list\" style=\"--logo-count:14;\">\n            <li class=\"logogrid-item\">\n            <div class=\"logogrid-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"167\" src=\"/images/2024/02/amana-vector-logo-300x167.png\" class=\"logogrid-image\" alt=\"Amana Heating &amp; Air Conditioning Logo\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/amana-vector-logo-300x167.png 300w, /images/2024/02/amana-vector-logo-768x427.png 768w, /images/2024/02/amana-vector-logo.png 900w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></div>        </li>\n            <li class=\"logogrid-item\">\n            <div class=\"logogrid-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"/images/2024/02/ruud-3d-square-300x300.png\" class=\"lo